# frigate/.env — COPY to .env (gitignored) and fill with the real Eufy RTSP creds.
# NEVER commit real values. Rotate the Eufy creds that leaked into git history (R21).
FRIGATE_RTSP_USER=
FRIGATE_RTSP_PASSWORD=
# MQTT (optional) — only needed to send detection events to HA. Install the Mosquitto broker add-on
# in HA, make a 'frigate' user, put it here, and enable mqtt in config.yaml. See runbooks/eufy-ha.md.
# FRIGATE_MQTT_USER=
# FRIGATE_MQTT_PASSWORD=
